          'tags': [],
          'url': 'https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.245',
          'body': '## What\'s changed\n\n- Fixed a crash on startup on Linux distributions that ship glibc 2.44 (for example Arch Linux, CachyOS and Fedora Rawhide)'
